    "title": "Not every job is legal.",
    "text": "Jobs / Classified Not every job is legal. The jobs listed on this page are the legitimate careers and activities available to players through the city's normal systems. There are also illegal ways to make money in NukeRoleplay. Those paths are intentionally not documented here. Classified · Your Choice If you decide to explore the criminal side of the city, remember that actions can have consequences. The police, courts and other systems of the city still apply.",
    "snippet": "Jobs / Classified Not every job is legal. The jobs listed on this page are the legitimate careers and activities available to players through the city's normal "
